title: "Differential Drive SLAM"
abstract: >-
  EKF-SLAM with maximum likelihood landmark association and log-odds occupancy
  grid mapping for a simulated differential drive robot, evaluated against
  ground truth for the consistency of its reported covariance rather than only
  for its accuracy.
